  "question": {
    "text": "The magnetic flux through a circuit of resistance <math> <mtext>R</mtext> </math> changes by an amount <math> <mrow> <mo>Δ</mo> <mi>ϕ</mi> </mrow> </math> in a time <math> <mrow> <mo>Δ</mo> <mtext>t</mtext> </mrow> </math>. Then the total quantity of electric charge <math> <mtext>Q</mtext> </math>, that passes through any point in the circuit during this&nbsp;<math><mrow><mo>Δ</mo> <mtext>t</mtext> </mrow> </math> time is, represented by",
